        },
        {
          "text": "Kuhle ukulibamba; yebo, ungasihoxisi isandla sakho kulokhu, ngokuba lowo omesabayo uNkulunkulu uyophuma kukho konke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.18",
