              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lokho umphefumulo wami osakufuna, kepha angikutholi; indoda eyodwa phakathi kwenkulungwane ngiyitholile; kepha angimtholanga owesifazane phakathi kwabo bonke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
